{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":499,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Blizzard_Bomb"},"children":["Blizzard Bomb"]},"\n"]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwBg"},"children":["\n\n\n"]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCA"},"children":["\n\n"]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwCg"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Wiki media omitted"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"dl","props":{},"children":[{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["Creates an isolated blizzard inside of a radius for 30 seconds that slows and freezes enemies nearby."]},{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["―"]},"In-Game Description"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Wiki media omitted"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"dl","props":{},"children":[{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["Creates an isolated blizzard inside of a radius for 20 seconds that slows and freezes enemies nearby."]},{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["―"]},"Former In-Game Description"]}]}]},"\n"]},"\n","\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwDA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Blizzard Bomb"]}," is the one of four Epic ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Consumables","title":"Consumables"},"children":["consumables"]},". The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Blizzard Bomb"]}," has a 1.11% (2.16% with ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/VIP+","title":"VIP+"},"children":["VIP+"]},") chance to be gotten from a ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Low_Grade_Crate","title":"Low Grade Crate"},"children":["Low Grade Crate"]},", 3.08% (4.71% with ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/VIP+","title":"VIP+"},"children":["VIP+"]},") chance to be gotten from a ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Mid_Grade_Crate","title":"Mid Grade Crate"},"children":["Mid Grade Crate"]}," and a 10.17% (10% with ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/VIP+","title":"VIP+"},"children":["VIP+"]},") chance to be gotten from a ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/High_Grade_Crate","title":"High Grade Crate"},"children":["High Grade Crate"]},", It can also be gotten from ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Holiday_Crate","title":"Holiday Crate"},"children":["Holiday Crate"]}," and has Chance of 8.33% (11.7% with ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/VIP+","title":"VIP+"},"children":["VIP+"]},") in ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Holiday_Crate","title":"Holiday Crate"},"children":["Holiday Crate"]},"."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Only up to five ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Blizzard Bombs"]}," can be used in a match by a single player. It has a 20 second cooldown, though when the match first starts the cooldown is set to 10 seconds. The cooldown does not start until the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Blizzard Bomb"]}," explodes."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwHQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Usage"},"children":["Usage"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["When using the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Blizzard Bomb"]},", your avatar's right hand will hold a radio, playing a custom idle animation. You will be able to choose a bomb drop location for the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Blizzard Bomb"]},". The bomb will create a snowstorm cloud of a 16 stud radius that drops icicles, slowing enemies every 0.25 tick and eventually freezing them in its area for 30 seconds. Freeze immune enemies, either from the regular ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Freeze_Immunity","title":"Freeze Immunity"},"children":["Freeze Immunity"]}," or the boss freeze immunity cannot be slowed down or frozen. If an enemy is on fire, it will not be frozen, though it will still be slowed down."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwIg"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Appearance"},"children":["Appearance"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Blizzard Bomb"]}," is a blue colored metal tube that has holes on each end, at the center of the bomb there is a black screen with wires connecting it to each of both holes."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwJQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Strategy"},"children":["Strategy"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Blizzard Bomb"]}," is very effective against groups of fast enemies such as the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Tank","title":"Tank"},"children":["Tank"]}," or ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Rusher","title":"Rusher"},"children":["Rusher"]},", slowing down large groups of enemies for an extended period of time allowing your towers more time to attack them.\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Do note that some enemies such as the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Amalgamation","title":"Amalgamation"},"children":["Amalgamation"]}," have ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Freeze_Immunity","title":"Freeze Immunity"},"children":["Freeze Immunity"]},", making the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Blizzard Bomb"]}," less effective against them."]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["The Level 4+ ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Sledger","title":"Sledger"},"children":["Sledger"]}," can work very well with the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Blizzard Bomb"]},", as the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Sledger","title":"Sledger"},"children":["Sledger"]}," will deal double damage to frozen and chilled enemies."]}]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwNA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Gallery"},"children":["Gallery"]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwNQ"},"children":["\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Props"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwOA"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwOQ"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/File:ConsumablePropBlizzardBomb.png","title":"Blizzard Bomb"},"children":["Blizzard Bomb"]}]}]},{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwPQ"},"children":["Blizzard Bomb"]}]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwPw"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwQA"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/File:ConsumablePropRadio.png","title":"Radio"},"children":["Radio"]}]}]},{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwRA"},"children":["Radio"]}]},"\n"]},"\n"]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwRQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Trivia"},"children":["Trivia"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["The appearance of the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Blizzard Bomb"]}," appears to have been based on the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.roblox.com/catalog/108875216"},"children":["Implosion Bomb"]}," gear from the Roblox catalog."]}]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwSg"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Update_History"},"children":["Update History"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":